    "title": "Freeze likely for many tonight - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kris Hudson ,\n10 hours ago WATERTOWN, New York (WWNY) - A chilly day will turn into a cold night with many locations seeing a frost and freeze by early Thursday morning. Thursday will be another cool day with a mix of sun and clouds. Friday highs will be back around 70 with mostly sunny skies. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
